# drizzle-kit writes these snapshots itself on every `db:generate` and reads them back to diff the
# next migration against. Formatting them makes `pnpm format` and `drizzle-kit` fight over the same
# bytes: prettier rewrites the file, the next generate rewrites it back, and `pnpm format:check`
# goes red in the `quality` job — which gates `deploy-production` — for a diff no human authored.
